NOTE ON WEIGHTS AND DATA

Checkpoints in weights/ were trained by the authors on public data and are
released under the same terms.

Third-party checkpoints evaluated in the paper (Chronos-2, MOMENT, Mantis,
MantisV2, CGMformer) are NOT redistributed here. They are downloaded from their
original sources by baselines/fetch_baselines.py and remain under their own
licences.

The source cohorts are public but are not redistributed. Each carries its own
access conditions and data-use agreement; see data/README.md.
